    "slug": "fishbone-manufacturing-defect-6m",
    "diagram": "fishbone",
    "title": "Manufacturing defect 6M fishbone",
    "description": "Ishikawa 6M root-cause analysis for a solder joint defect spike on an electronics assembly line.",
